configs/, runner.py, compat.py, conftest.py, and the released result artefacts.
It does not override the terms below.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AgentClinic  --  upstream/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

upstream/agentclinic.py is an unmodified copy of AgentClinic, and
upstream/agentclinic_*.jsonl are its scenario corpora, redistributed here so the
experiment is self-contained. AgentClinic is distributed under the MIT licence
and its notice is reproduced in full below, as that licence requires. A copy also
sits at upstream/LICENSE.txt alongside the files it covers.

    Schmidgall, S., Ziaei, R., Harris, C., Reis, E., Jopling, J., and Moor, M.
    AgentClinic: A Multimodal Agent Benchmark to Evaluate AI in Simulated
    Clinical Environments. arXiv:2405.07960, 2024.
    https://github.com/SamuelSchmidgall/AgentClinic

    MIT License

