--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MedQA  --  scenario provenance
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The AgentClinic MedQA scenarios above derive from the MedQA dataset. This work
uses them only as simulation inputs and reports no MedQA question-answering
result.

    Jin, D., Pan, E., Oufattole, N., Weng, W.-H., Fang, H., and Szolovits, P.
    What Disease Does This Patient Have? A Large-Scale Open Domain Question
    Answering Dataset from Medical Exams. Applied Sciences 11(14):6421, 2021.
